  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_005 (rna_only with scvi_n200 and avgpool) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.650). The next step is to test whether multimodal approaches with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder can match or exceed this performance. Config_031 tests the same RNA/image encoder pair as config_030 but uses weighted fusion instead of concat, isolating the effect of fusion strategy. This comparison helps determine if weighted fusion improves performance over simple concatenation in multimodal settings, while building on the strong foundation of scvi_n200 and resnet50."
}

